        <activityName xml:lang="en">Sulphate pulp, TCF bleached, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Sulphate pulp, TCF bleached, at plant
na;
Synonyms: kraft pulp, Kraftzellstoff; 
UUID: f8949eab-a48d-3a8a-8969-5dbf027a9ade
This module includes the production of sulphate pulp with the TCF bleaching process - including transports to the pulp mill, wood handling, chemical pulping and bleaching, drying process, energy production on-site, recovery cycles of chemicals and internal waste water treatment.; Geography: Data from a finnish database and from several Scandinavian producers used as European average data.' where ID=449046;This module includes the production of sulphate pulp with the TCF bleaching process - including transports to the pulp mill, wood handling, chemical pulping and bleaching, drying process, energy production on-site, recovery cycles of chemicals and internal waste water treatment.; Geography: Data from a finnish database and from several Scandinavian producers used as European average data.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Modern average technology.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: Total European market sulphate pulp production in 2000: 9297 kt
Sampling: &lt;null&gt;
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: &lt;null&gt;
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_f8949eab-a48d-3a8a-8969-5dbf027a9ade.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
